      "extraSectionsHtml": "\n    <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n      <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-[var(--card)] border border-indigo-500/40 space-y-3\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n          <div class=\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-[var(--content)] border border-sky-500/30\">\n            <div class=\"font-bold text-sky-400 uppercase text-[11px] mb-1\">❓ WHY Is This Relevant in Machine Learning?</div>\n            <div class=\"text-[var(--foreground)] leading-relaxed\">Without Log-Odds, Logistic Regression couldn't use a linear weighted sum β₀ + β₁x₁ + β₂x₂! Exponentiating βⱼ gives e^βⱼ = exact Odds Ratio multiplier.</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-[var(--content)] border border-emerald-500/30\">\n            <div class=\"font-bold text-emerald-400 uppercase text-[11px] mb-1\">📐 Exact Formula to Solve It (Step-by-Step Recipe)</div>\n            <div class=\"text-[var(--foreground)] font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed\">p → Odds = p ÷ (1 − p) → Log-Odds z = ln(Odds)<br>Reverse (Sigmoid): p = 1 ÷ (1 + e^(−z))<br>1 Extra Hour multiplies Pass Odds by e^(β₁)!</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-[var(--card)] border border-sky-500/40 space-y-3\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-[var(--border)] pb-2.5\">\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-300 border border-sky-500/40\">LOGISTIC REGRESSION ONLY • 1D vs MULTI-D</span>\n            <h4 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold mt-1\">Interactive Sigmoid, Odds & Multiplicative Odds Ratio Explorer</h4>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 items-center\">\n            <button onclick=\"window.V7Studios.state.oddsMode='single'; window.V7Studios.renderLogitOdds()\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-sky-500/20 border border-sky-500/40 text-xs font-bold hover:bg-sky-500/30\">1-Param (Hours)</button>\n            <button onclick=\"window.V7Studios.state.oddsMode='multi'; window.V7Studios.renderLogitOdds()\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 border border-emerald-500/40 text-xs font-bold hover:bg-emerald-500/30\">Multi-Param (+Tests)</button>\n            <label class=\"text-xs font-mono\">Hours: <input id=\"v7-odds-hrs\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"5.5\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"3.5\" oninput=\"window.V7Studios.renderLogitOdds()\" class=\"accent-sky-400 align-middle\"></label>\n            <label class=\"text-xs font-mono\">Tests: <input id=\"v7-odds-tests\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" oninput=\"window.V7Studios.renderLogitOdds()\" class=\"accent-emerald-400 align-middle\"></label>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <canvas id=\"v7-canvas-odds\" width=\"780\" height=\"310\" class=\"w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] block\"></canvas>\n        <div id=\"v7-odds-readout\" class=\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-[var(--content)] border border-[var(--border)] font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--foreground)]\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    ",
