        workedExample: `Step-by-Step Hand-Worked Numerical Traces:\n\nPart A: AdaBoost Amount of Say:\nStump misclassifies 1 out of 10 weighted rows ⟹ Total Error ε = 0.10:\n1. Odds ratio: (1 − 0.10) / 0.10 = 0.90 / 0.10 = 9.0\n2. ln(9.0) = 2.1972\n3. α = 0.5 × 2.1972 = 1.0986\n4. Weight update: Misclassified sample weight multiplies by e^(1.0986) = 3.00 (3× higher attention next round!).\n\nPart B: XGBoost Split Gain & Pruning:\nLeft Child: Left Mistake Sum = −4.0, Left Brake Sum = 3.0; Right Child: Right Mistake Sum = 3.5, Right Brake Sum = 4.0; λ = 1.0, γ = 1.5:\n1. Left Bucket Score = (−4.0)² / (3.0 + 1.0) = 16.0 / 4.0 = 4.00\n2. Right Bucket Score = (3.5)² / (4.0 + 1.0) = 12.25 / 5.0 = 2.45\n3. S_Parent = (−4.0 + 3.5)² / (3.0 + 4.0 + 1.0) = (−0.5)² / 8.0 = 0.25 / 8.0 = 0.031\n4. Gain = 0.5 × [ 4.00 + 2.45 − 0.031 ] − 1.50 = 0.5 × 6.419 − 1.50 = 3.209 − 1.50 = +1.709\n5. Pruning Decision: Because Gain = +1.709 > 0, XGBoost KEEPS this split!`,
