        intuition: `Machine Learning code accounts for less than 15% of a real production AI system. The remaining 85% is data ingestion, schema validation (Pydantic), API serving (FastAPI), container orchestration (Docker/Kubernetes), and continuous monitoring for Data Drift (Covariate Shift) and Concept Drift. When customer distributions drift over time, models silently fail without throwing errors! MLOps detects and prevents these silent failures.`,
